2. Global Storage Rules

Every persistent MOS object follows these rules unless explicitly overridden.

ID
UUID

No auto-incrementing integer IDs for MOS domain objects.

Time
TIMESTAMPTZ

All timestamps are UTC.

Deletion

Authoritative objects use:

ON DELETE RESTRICT

by default.

Physical deletion is prohibited for immutable historical objects.

Metadata

Free-form metadata uses:

JSONB

but semantic fields must be normal relational columns.

Version

Where versioning applies:

BIGINT

starting at:

1

Version numbers are monotonically increasing.

